. *==============================================================
. * DETRENDING (ln market cap only): fit a CA-specific linear trend on the
. * pre-law years (2011-2018) and keep the residuals. Same as the detrended
. * columns of Sophia's panel tables.
. *==============================================================
. gen ca_year = ca*fyr

. 
